From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Honor configured libdir in pkg-config metadata

The upstream template hard-codes libdir to prefix/lib, which is wrong on
multilib targets that install into lib64. Use Autoconf's configured libdir.

--- a/shine.pc.in
+++ b/shine.pc.in
@@ -4 +4 @@
-libdir=${exec_prefix}/lib
+libdir=@libdir@
